#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:5 bf864f2d1e844b179e8d5e994a3b3245
msgid "Using SITL with Morse"
msgstr "将 SITL 与 Morse 配合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:10 8393fb61282649e9a1af49cc0b21d0d0
msgid ""
"`Morse <http://www.openrobots.org/morse/doc/stable/morse.html>`__ is an open"
" robotics platform that uses python APIs and the blender 3D environment to "
"create a complete robotics platform."
msgstr ""
"`Morse <http://www.openrobots.org/morse/doc/stable/morse.html>`__ 是一个使用 "
"Python API 和 Blender 三维环境的开放机器人平台，用于创建完整的机器人平台。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:14 c028d4f9df3e430aadffce83b0267897
msgid ""
"ArduPilot has a Morse SITL simulation backend that allows ArduPilot to "
"control vehicles created within Morse."
msgstr "ArduPilot 有一个 Morse SITL 仿真后端，允许 ArduPilot 控制在 Morse 中创建的飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:19 2d0f70b78e1d4755a23d448cdb2ec381
msgid ""
"Morse is no longer maintained so we recommend developers use :ref:`AirSim "
"<sitl-with-airsim>` or :ref:`Webots <sitl-with-webots>`."
msgstr ""
"Morse 已不再维护，建议开发者使用 :ref:`AirSim <sitl-with-airsim>` 或 :ref:`Webots <sitl-"
"with-webots>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:23 3691a04fb668496f8db1fa7a3807f8ab
msgid "Morse has only been tested on Linux/Ubuntu environments"
msgstr "Morse 仅在 Linux/Ubuntu 环境下经过测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:26 cbc14949325a4093978c7da0a7921d15
msgid "Installing Morse"
msgstr "安装 Morse"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:28 75d17aaa3c7a4ef8b0b09e716e660088
msgid ""
"`Official instructions can be found on openrobots.com "
"<http://www.openrobots.org/morse/doc/stable/user/installation.html>`__. "
"Morse uses the Blender Game Engine API to render the build scripts. If the "
"user is installing Morse on Ubuntu 20.04 or later, install the software from"
" the source(manual installation) as described on the Morse installation "
"page(mentioned above). But for older Ubuntu  installs all you need is"
msgstr ""
"`官方说明可在 openrobots.com 上找到 "
"<http://www.openrobots.org/morse/doc/stable/user/installation.html>`__。Morse"
" 使用 Blender Game Engine API 来渲染构建脚本。如果用户在 Ubuntu 20.04 或更新版本上安装 Morse，请按照上述 "
"Morse 安装页面中的说明从源码进行安装（手动安装）。但对于较旧的 Ubuntu 安装，只需执行以下命令："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:35 7812823f4a9648a5aeb585b145a6e4a2
msgid "Checking the blender version"
msgstr "检查 Blender 版本"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:36 25b25839ceef41289ce328f55611dc53
msgid ""
"As mentioned above, Morse relies on the Blender Game Engine for rendering "
"the simulations. Given the fact that the newer Blender versions (**v2.80** "
"and above) have discontinued the support for the game engine, users are "
"requested to ensure that the installed `Blender version "
"<https://download.blender.org/release/>`__ ranges between **v2.65**  to "
"**v2.73** (Official version limit stated by Morse)."
msgstr ""
"如上所述，Morse 依赖 Blender Game Engine 来渲染仿真。鉴于较新版本的 Blender（**v2.80** "
"及以上）已停止对游戏引擎的支持，请确保安装的 `Blender 版本 "
"<https://download.blender.org/release/>`__ 在 **v2.65** 至 **v2.73** 之间（Morse "
"官方声明的版本限制）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:40 4fbc50c526974fba9b5f55c4cd3042c5
msgid ""
"Blender **v2.74** - **v2.79** are also valid versions, as these versions "
"also provide access to a stable Blender Game Engine. The below image shows "
"ArduPilot's quadcopter Morse simulation running with Blender 2.76."
msgstr ""
"Blender **v2.74** 到 **v2.79** 也是有效版本，因为这些版本也提供对稳定 Blender Game Engine "
"的访问。下图显示了在 Blender 2.76 上运行的 ArduPilot 四旋翼 Morse 仿真。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:47 61b69d8641534853ac14c1f174cb9aec
msgid "Builder Scripts"
msgstr "构建脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:49 493776b7854c4060a675a9be91c36d27
msgid ""
"The Morse simulator has the concept of builder scripts, which are python "
"scripts setup to run within the Morse/Blender environment."
msgstr "Morse 仿真器有构建脚本的概念，这些脚本是设置为在 Morse/Blender 环境中运行的 Python 脚本。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:52 7c026e8e8b8341f9a25b35828e23c860
msgid ""
"Some example builder scripts for use with ArduPilot are provided in the "
"`ArduPilot/libraries/SITL/examples/Morse directory "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/SITL/examples/Morse>`__."
msgstr ""
"`ArduPilot/libraries/SITL/examples/Morse 目录 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/SITL/examples/Morse>`__"
" 中提供了一些与 ArduPilot 配合使用的示例构建脚本。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:54 db061a1a9c434ac0892c0d65df06f9bb
msgid "The examples include:"
msgstr "示例包括："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:56 3c93a7a20d3849779499dc422bd6ec79
msgid "skid rover"
msgstr "滑移转向 Rover"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:57 f3c17d1078ec447aa152b6ff7d3abd86
msgid "separate Steering and Throttle rover"
msgstr "转向和油门分离的 Rover"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:58 62f52244fd954145b6d8fd8c039a03ce
msgid "a simple quadcopter"
msgstr "简单四旋翼"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:59 c340ffc35d074c4fb2a2b5170bfd7cca
msgid "a rover with a scanning laser rangefinder"
msgstr "带扫描激光测距仪的 Rover"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:61 4559180d3885481bb321b937023597f2
msgid ""
"These scripts setup the standard sensor suite that ArduPilot needs and "
"exports them using the socket API. It is recommended that you read through "
"both the rover.py and quadcopter.py examples to better understand how to "
"interface Morse with ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"这些脚本设置了 ArduPilot 所需的标准传感器套件，并通过套接字 API 将其导出。建议您通读 rover.py 和 quadcopter.py "
"两个示例，以更好地了解如何将 Morse 与 ArduPilot 对接。"

