#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:174 da8b74c9c61543b6b09dbd9c807893db
msgid "To connect with Mission Planner"
msgstr "连接 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:176 017fa5fba2b54f4b93572b142a601cd1
msgid ""
"On the Windows machine open a terminal (on the windows machine) and type "
"``ipconfig`` to determine the machines IP address"
msgstr "在 Windows 机器上打开终端，输入 ``ipconfig`` 确定该机器的 IP 地址。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:177 28d7be55dac64f558cdd0614ebe5a1dc
msgid "On the Ubuntu machine"
msgstr "在 Ubuntu 机器上"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:179 d377d007701d477fac0f562e4f72033b
msgid ""
"open your favourite editor and edit "
"``libraries/SITL/examples/Morse/start_follow.sh``"
msgstr "打开您喜欢的编辑器，编辑 ``libraries/SITL/examples/Morse/start_follow.sh``"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:180 7cdb20a6a5714950bd481826c6987338
msgid "modify line 7 of the script to set your windows machines IP address"
msgstr "修改脚本第 7 行，设置您的 Windows 机器 IP 地址"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:186 2f3f9d554d704eb69173802b32857659
msgid ""
"On the Windows machine start Mission Planner, set the connection type drop-"
"down to \"UDP\" and press \"Connect\""
msgstr "在 Windows 机器上启动 Mission Planner，将连接类型下拉框设为「UDP」并按「连接」"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-morse.rst:187 1d875c32e31a49f6883f39fcf546277d
msgid ""
"The three vehicles should appear on the map. They can be controlled "
"separately by changing the vehicle selector drop-down just below the "
"\"Connect\" button"
msgstr "三辆飞行器应出现在地图上，可通过更改「连接」按钮下方的飞行器选择下拉框分别控制它们。"
